{"sections":[{"slug":"平展同伦论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"平展同伦论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">平展同伦论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“平展同伦论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">平展同伦的概念可理解为如下经典事实的推广</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">考虑仿紧</span> (paracompact) <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的好覆盖</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即任意有限个开集的交为空或可缩</span>) $\\{U_i \\to X\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cech脉","text":"Cech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">逐项取其连通分支的集合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">所得的单纯集表现了</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦型</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于局部可缩空间</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">没有好覆盖的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但可以考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/超覆盖","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">超覆盖</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的类似构造</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对所有超覆盖给出的单纯集取极限</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在任何</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上都可以做类似的事情</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上做的事情叫做平展同伦论</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But the concept is much more general. In particular, one can understand the construction of the limit over contractions of hypercovers as a presentation of naturally defined (∞,1)-functors in (∞,1)-topos theory.</p>\n<p>Notably, if the given site is a locally ∞-connected site, then the étale homotopy construction computes precisely the derived functor that presents the <strong>fundamental ∞-groupoid</strong> in a locally ∞-connected (∞,1)-topos. Many constructions in the literature can be understood as being explicit realizations of this simple general concept.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象的形","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象的形</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}